Hi everyone,

I just wanted to thank all those who have worked to get decent support
in
sony-laptop. I was on a train ride and before shutting down the laptop
I typed acpi; uptime and got
       Battery 0: Discharging, 1%, 00:05:05 remaining
        16:50:54 up  5:26,  3 users,  load average: 0.05, 0.05, 0.02
which means 5 1/2 hours of uptime on the default battery. I was coding
most of the times, with a few compile runs, a few breaks for food/etc,
but
generally permanently busy with powertop reporting between 9.5W and 10W.

Again, thanks a lot and all the best

Norbert

